   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A supporter of main challenger and reformist candidate Mir Hossein Mousavi forms a heart shape with her hands to indicate her support, while wearing green ribbons - the color of the party, amidst a festive atmosphere at an election rally rally in Tehran, Iran, Tuesday, June 9, 2009. (AP Photo/Ben Curtis) ... Mideast Iran Election ... 09-06-2009 ... Tehran ... Iran ... Photo credit should read: Ben Curtis/AP. Unique Reference No. 7419672 ... </rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
